{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30405","headline":"寄淮南幕中刘员外 · 赵嘏","name":"寄淮南幕中刘员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郎官何逊最风流，爱月怜山不下楼。\n三佐戎旃换朱绂，一辞兰省见清秋。\n桂生岩石本潇洒，鹤到烟空更自由。\n休向西斋久闲卧，满朝倾盖是依刘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}